        "country": "EEA",
        "role": "primary",
        "regionSelected": true,
        "note": "An EEA Region places customer content in that Region. Note that of the Regions whose identifier begins eu-, London (eu-west-2) is in the United Kingdom and Zurich (eu-central-2) is in Switzerland; neither is in the EEA."
      },
      {
        "country": "US",
